stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 48 752 Td 16 TL
(Quorum Gate) Tj T*
(Quorum Gate: a batch is released only when three independent verifiers sign the same epoch) Tj T*
(digest within 5 ticks.) Tj T*
(If a signature is delayed past 5 ticks or duplicated by the same verifier, the tally) Tj T*
(resets to zero.) Tj T*
(Advisory pings do not count toward the three-verifier quorum.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
