endobj
9 0 obj
<< /Length 139 >>
stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 48 752 Td 16 TL
(Verifier Roles) Tj T*
(Verifiers operate independently and never share transient signature buffers.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
