stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 48 752 Td 16 TL
(Lease Backoff) Tj T*
(Lease Backoff: after a worker lease timeout, the worker waits 8 ticks before requesting) Tj T*
(renewal.) Tj T*
(Lease Backoff only throttles renewal attempts; it does not authorize batch release.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
14 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 15 0 R >>
endobj
15 0 obj
<< /Length 143 >>
stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 48 752 Td 16 TL
(Retry Accounting) Tj T*
(Failed renewals increment the backoff counter without altering queued batches.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
